"textMapHash":3747463114,"text":"あっ！話が終わったみたいだぞ。いまだ！","nextNodeIds":[760310305]},{"nodeId":760310305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15409,"speakerName":"マチェイ","textMapHash":3017939226,"text":"ラウマ様！","nextNodeIds":[760310306]},{"nodeId":760310306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1223420402,"text":"またかよ！","nextNodeIds":[760310307]},{"nodeId":760310307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":1122983138,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[760310308]},{"nodeId":760310308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":3724344842,"text":"…苦労をかけたな。少し出かけるが、すぐ戻る。","nextNodeIds":[760310309]},{"nodeId":760310309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":752619762,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[760310310]},{"nodeId":760310310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":2473285850,"text":"もう誰もおらぬ。出てきてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[760310311]},{"nodeId":760310311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2385783138,"text":"なんだ、気付いてたのか。","nextNodeIds":[760310312]},{"nodeId":760310312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":749361074,"text":"「クー{RUBY#[D]月の少女}タル」から放たれるクーヴァキに気付かぬわけないだろう？","nextNodeIds":[760310313]},{"nodeId":760310313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":735875618,"text":"なぜ後をつけていた？…私の仕事を視察でもしていたのか？","nextNodeIds":[760310314]},{"nodeId":760310314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4096778098,"text":"うぅ…ご…ごめん。実はラウマに聞きたいことがあって来たんだけど、なかなかタイミングを掴めなくて…嫌な思いさせちゃったか…","nextNodeIds":[760310315]},{"nodeId":760310315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":733798978,"text":"そうか…なるほど。善処しよう。","nextNodeIds":[760310316]},{"nodeId":760310316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":234709242,"text":"でも、おまえの一日の仕事ぶりを見て、これ以上負担をかけるのが忍びなくなってきたぜ。","nextNodeIds":[760310317]},{"nodeId":760310317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":385768322,"text":"大したことはない。「詠月使」としてやるべきことをしておるだけだ。","nextNodeIds":[760310318]},{"nodeId":760310318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":3583911650,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[760310319]},{"nodeId":760310319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":4083504874,"text":"…ん？","nextNodeIds":[760310320]},{"nodeId":760310320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":1258578298,"text":"…ところで、今日「霜月の子」を見て、「クー{RUBY#[D]月の少女}タル」はどう思った？","nextNodeIds":[760310321]},{"nodeId":760310321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1619333994,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[760310322]},{"nodeId":760310322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3860637058,"text":"数百年前とはずいぶん雰囲気が変わった。いい意味でね。","nextNodeIds":[760310323]},{"nodeId":760310323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":402819034,"text":"そうか…ありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[760310324]},{"nodeId":760310324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3468153386,"text":"手を出して。","nextNodeIds":[760310325]},{"nodeId":760310325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3083970234,"text":"旅人も。","nextNodeIds":[760310326]},{"nodeId":760310326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1315,"speakerName":"ラウマ","textMapHash":4073650258,"text":"…？なにゆえ…？","nextNodeIds":[760310327]},{"nodeId":760310327,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3090289386,"text":"さっきキミが言ってた、祈りの言葉…気に入った。","nextNodeIds":[760310328]},{"nodeId":760310328,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1172361842,"text":"…昼も夜も、月光が我らを結ばん。","nextNode